#!/bin/sh
# The cheap tier of the verification bar, on every commit. The rules, and why these four
# gates and not the other six, live in xtask/src/verify.rs; this file stays a shim so
# there is exactly one implementation and the hook cannot drift from it.
#
# Measured at 0.3s, against 40s for the full bar -- which is the whole point. A gate you
# think about running is a gate you skip.
#
# Two things this deliberately does not do. It checks the WORKING TREE, not the index, so
# a partially-staged commit is checked against what is on disk; and it does not run the
# test suite, so `cargo xtask verify` (the task tier) is still owed before the work is
# reviewed. CI remains the backstop for both, exactly as the commit-msg gate documents.
#
# Activated per machine by `cargo xtask setup`, which sets core.hooksPath to this
# directory. That is local to .git/config and cannot travel in a commit.
exec cargo xtask verify fast
